          "title": "You'll want to know: നഗരസഭ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "നഗരസഭ — nagarasabha — \"a municipality\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "നഗരസഭ തെരുവുകളിൽ പുതിയ വിളക്കുകൾ വച്ചു. nagarasabha teruvukaḷil putiya viḷakkukaḷ vaccu. The municipality put up new lamps in the streets."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The council of a town; a village has a പഞ്ചായത്ത്."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "നഗരസഭ (nagarasabha) is a Malayalam compound built from നഗരം, a town, from Sanskrit nagara (CDIAL 6924), and സഭ, an assembly, from Sanskrit sabhā (Monier-Williams)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for getting around."
            }
          ]
        },
