          "title": "You'll want to know: വില്ലേജ് ഓഫീസ്",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "വില്ലേജ് ഓഫീസ് — villējŭ ōphīsŭ — \"a village office\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "സർട്ടിഫിക്കറ്റിനായി ഞാൻ വില്ലേജ് ഓഫീസിൽ പോയി. sarṭṭiphikkaṟṟināyi ñān villējŭ ōphīsil pōyi. I went to the village office for a certificate."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The office of the smallest revenue area; land records and many certificates come from it."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "വില്ലേജ് ഓഫീസ് (villējŭ ōphīsŭ) was borrowed from English village office, the name of the local revenue office."
            }
          ]
        },
