          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "താലൂക്ക് — tālūkkŭ — \"a taluk\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ഞങ്ങളുടെ ജില്ലയിൽ ആറ് താലൂക്കുകൾ ഉണ്ട്. ñaṅṅaḷuṭe jillayil āṟŭ tālūkkukaḷ uṇṭŭ. Our district has six taluks."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Plural: താലൂക്കുകൾ, tālūkkukaḷ."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A district is split into taluks, and a taluk into villages."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "താലൂക്ക് (tālūkkŭ) is usually traced to Arabic taʿalluq, \"a dependency\", which reached the south through Hindustani as a word for a revenue division."
            }
          ]
        },
